 {"id":"lean-bulk-12","name":"12-Week Lean Bulk","category":"Bulking","weeks":12,"daysPerWeek":5,"level":"Intermediate",
  "summary":"A five-day upper/lower plus push/pull/legs hybrid with a controlled calorie surplus to add size without much fat.",
  "nutrition":"Eat a 250-400 kcal surplus. Target 0.25-0.5% body weight gain per week; adjust calories every 2 weeks.",
  "progression":"Add reps first, then weight. Each 4-week block adds one set to your two biggest lifts per day.",
